ramme rules, under article 60.º, n.º 2, c), of Lei n.º 23/2007), article 5.º, n.os 1 to 3: eligibility of entrepreneurs and their projects","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-25"},{"id":"lei-23-2007-public-order","url":"https://diariodarepublica.pt/dr/detalhe/lei/18-2022-200268064","machineReadableUrl":"https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2022/08/16400/0000200137.pdf","title":"Lei n.º 23/2007, article 52.º, n.º 4: a visa is refused to a danger or threat to public order, security, national defence or public health","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-25"},{"id":"lei-23-2007-illegal-stay","url":"https://diariodarepublica.pt/dr/detalhe/lei/61-2025-941547426","machineReadableUrl":"https://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2025/10/20400/0000900017.pdf","title":"Lei n.º 61/2025, adding article 52.º, n.º 10, to Lei n.º 23/2007: a residence visa is refused after an illegal entry or stay in Portugal where article 144.º, n.º 1, applies","kind":"official","verifiedAt":"2026-11-25"}],"countries":{"id":"countries","number":1},"formerCountries":{"id":"former-countries","number":1},"officialDomains":[{"id":"pt","number":1}],"countrySets":[{"id":"eu-free-movement","number":2}],"leapDayBirthday":"unsettled","requirements":[{"id":"not-eu-eea-or-swiss-citizen","title":"Not a citizen of an EU or EEA state or of Switzerland, Portugal included: the foreigners law, and so this visa, does not apply to them","expression":{"op":"not","operand":{"op":"intersects","list":{"op":"fact","key":"principal.citizenships"},"set":{"op":"set","id":"eu-free-movement"}}},"sources":["lei-23-2007-scope"]}],"assessments":[{"id":"independent-activity-or-investment","title":"One of: a contract or written proposal for services in a liberal profession, or a company contract; investments made; means in Portugal and an intent to invest; a project in a certified incubator","evidence":["principal.monthlyActiveIncome","unit.liquidAssets"],"sources":["lei-23-2007-independent","lei-23-2007-entrepreneur","lei-23-